<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 128 0 R/T(United Nations )/E(United Nations )/Pg 12 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

204 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 128 0 R/T(Human Rights Council \(UNHRC\))/E(Human Rights Council \(UNHRC\))/Pg 12 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

205 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 128 0 R/E(The General Assembly formed the United Nations Human Rights Council in 2006 by adopting the resolution 60/251. The Commission had been criticised by various quarters for its politicization and its inability to take an effective action when faced with serious human rights violations, and the Council was established to provide a more effective and credible means by which the United Nations could promote and protect human rights around the world. Its activities are based on the principles laid out in the Universal Declaration of Human Rights in 1948.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

206 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/P 128 0 R/T(Introduction to the Committee)/E(Introduction to the Committee)/Pg 12 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

207 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 128 0 R/Pg 12 0 R/A[536 0 R 0]/K[11]>>
endobj

208 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 128 0 R/Pg 12 0 R/A[573 0 R 0]/K[12]>>
endobj

209 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 128 0 R/Pg 12 0 R/A[574 0 R 0]/K[13]>>
endobj

210 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 128 0 R/Pg 12 0 R/A[537 0 R 0]/K[14]>>
endobj

